@anon.984efe779a4077b66be6415f964eeb42.2198 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [242 x i8] }> <{ [242 x i8] c"The citation key that identifies the entry in the bibliography that\0Ashall be cited, as a label.\0A\0A```example\0A// All the same\0A@netwok \\\0A#cite(<netwok>) \\\0A#cite(label(\22netwok\22))\0A>>> #set text(0pt)\0A>>> #bibliography(\22works.bib\22, style: \22apa\22)\0A```" }>, align 1
